# Scoring Rubric (Growth Lens)

1. Revenue Growth & Durability (30 pts): 3-5y growth rate, deceleration trend,
   recurring/contracted revenue mix, customer cohort behavior.
2. Total Addressable Market (20 pts): Size, current penetration, expansion
   vectors (geo, product, segment). Reward large under-penetrated TAMs.
3. Unit Economics & Margin Trajectory (20 pts): Gross margin level and trend,
   incremental margins, path to GAAP profitability if not yet there.
4. Reinvestment & Moat-in-the-Making (15 pts): R&D efficiency, network effects
   forming, distribution lock-in, switching costs growing.
5. Valuation Sanity (10 pts): PS/PEG relative to growth — penalize when
   forward growth cannot bridge the multiple within ~3 years.
6. Catalyst (5 pts): Product launches, geo expansion, S-curve inflection.

Penalize "growth at any price" — if PEG > 3 with decelerating growth, cap at 60.

# Output (JSON ONLY — no prose, no markdown fences)

Return EXACTLY one JSON object with these keys:
{
  "score": <int 0-100>,
  "confidence": <float 0.0-1.0>,
  "bull_thesis": "<3-5 sentence growth case grounded in the data above>",
  "bear_thesis": "<3-5 sentence risk case — saturation, competition, multiple compression>",
  "key_metrics_explained": {"revenue_growth_yoy": "...", "gross_margin": "...", "ps": "...", "peg": "..."},
  "tam_estimate": "<short string e.g. '$200B by 2030', or null>",
  "revenue_growth_3y_cagr": <float estimated 3-yr forward CAGR, or null>
}

Output ONLY the JSON object. No commentary before or after.
